}],["$","circle","3-3",{"cx":70,"cy":70,"r":"3","fill":"var(--primary)"}]]}]]}]}],["$","$Ld",null,{"delay":140,"direction":"right","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-tag","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Our Story"}]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-heading","style":{"marginBottom":"1.25rem"},"children":["World-Class Facilities,",["$","br",null,{}],"Rooted in Compassion"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-light)","lineHeight":1.8,"marginBottom":"1.1rem"},"children":"Located in Hwidiem, St. Elizabeth Catholic Hospital serves as a regional centre of excellence for the Asutifi South District and surrounding communities — offering a wide range of clinical services under one roof, 24 hours a day."}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-light)","lineHeight":1.8,"marginBottom":"2rem"},"children":"Our multidisciplinary team of physicians, nurses, and allied health professionals bring skill, empathy, and faith to every patient encounter — from routine outpatient visits to complex surgical procedures."}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"display":"flex","gap":14,"flexWrap":"wrap"},"children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/about","className":"btn-primary","children":"Our History"}],["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/about#team","className":"btn-outline","children":"Meet the Team"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}],["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","$Lf",null,{"preview":true,"posts":[{"slug":"djavdhjvhjkd","title":"BREASTFEEDING IS THE EASIEST CHOICE","excerpt":"<p>Breastfeeding offers immense benefits for both baby and mother. It provides perfect nutrition, antibodies, and DHA for strong immunity, brain development, and emotional bonding, while helping babies develop healthy jaws and teeth.<br />\nChallenges like sore nipples can be overcome with patience and a positive mindset. It saves families money, helps mothers lose pregnancy weight faster, and burns extra calories daily.<br />\nBreast size does not limit milk supply — frequent nursing, nutrition, and hydration do. Contrary to fears, breastfeeding does not ruin breast shape more than age or gravity.<br />\nBy Pearl Exornam Selormey, Nutritionist</p>\n","date":"2026-06-16T16:49:52","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"News"}]}},{"slug":"advvdav","title":"advvdav","excerpt":"<p>fvbafdv</p>\n","date":"2026-06-15T15:18:39","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"News"}]}},{"slug":"thertdfcgf","title":"Donation recieved from Mr. John Boakye Dankwah","excerpt":"","date":"2026-06-03T13:49:15","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"News"}]}},{"slug":"patients-rights-and-responsibilities-part-two","title":"Patient’s Rights and Responsibilities – part two","excerpt":"","date":"2022-05-27T00:10:00","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"Education"},{"name":"healthnews"}]}},{"slug":"patients-rights-and-responsibilities","title":"Patient’s Rights and Responsibilities – part one","excerpt":"","date":"2022-05-26T19:53:28","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"Education"},{"name":"healthnews"}]}},{"slug":"international-day-of-the-midwife","title":"International Day of the Midwife","excerpt":"","date":"2022-05-05T13:37:05","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"Events"}]}},{"slug":"5128","title":"WORLD BREASTFEEDING WEEK CELEBRATION","excerpt":"<p>BREASTFEEDING IS THE EASIEST CHOICE Have you ever thought of how important it is for a woman to breastfeed and its enormous benefits to her baby and family? It is indeed very easy for a mother to just conclude that breastfeeding is very problematic due to the stress it sometimes comes with. But it can &hellip; <a href=\"https://sech-gh.org/2017/08/02/5128/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">WORLD BREASTFEEDING WEEK CELEBRATION</span> <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;</span></a></p>\n","date":"2017-08-02T18:39:21","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"healthnews"}]}},{"slug":"we-are-proud-of-you-dr-richard-selormey","title":"We are proud of you Dr. Richard Selormey","excerpt":"<p>&nbsp; Dr. Richard Selormey, St. Elizabeth is proud of you for your achievements.</p>\n","date":"2015-09-11T17:43:06","categories":{"nodes":[{"name":"Headlines"}]}}]}],["$","$L10",null,{}]]
